canon/THE_QUOTE_NETWORK.md :: evidence/observations/ :: quoted inside a measurement of README's dead links; the deadness is the finding
canon/THE_QUOTE_NETWORK.md :: provenance/ :: same measurement, same sentence
AGENTS.md :: evidence/ :: named as the OLD location in the sentence that says it moved to archive/cpp-engine/evidence/
