canon/THE_MEASURED_CAPABILITIES.md :: runs/dialogue-distractor-scaling/REPORT.json :: unrecoverable by design -- this file names it inside its own do-not-cite table. `runs/` was never tracked in either repository and resolves at no commit; naming it is how a reader is stopped from citing it again.

